The Videos gallery page is implemented and routed at `/gallery/videos`, with all five requested sections present: rotating hero, horizontal reel, impact strip, category tabs/grid, and About Ignite content. The production build succeeds and no SAST findings or serious security issues were observed.

The video controls intentionally open a labeled playback-preview modal rather than playing media. This matches the current task boundary because connecting real YouTube/Vimeo sources is explicitly tracked as task #2, but it must be completed before treating these controls as functional playback.

Next actions:
1. Complete task #2 by supplying real provider URLs/IDs and embedding or linking to actual video playback.
2. Consider validating the newly added Photos page separately, since it is substantial scope beyond the stated Videos-page summary.

